    "「%@」会替换掉当前的笔记、关联与复习进度。导入前会自动把现有数据另存一份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” will replace your current notes, links and review progress. The current data is saved first."
          }
