    "备份已生成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup created"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份是一个 .weave 压缩包，里面有笔记文件与图片，换机或重装后导入即可回到原样。Markdown 导出只保留正文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A backup is a .weave archive holding the note file and its images, so you can move devices or reinstall and get everything back. The Markdown export keeps the text only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份是一个 .weave 压缩包，里面有笔记文件与图片，换机或重装后导入即可回到原样（旧版导出过的纯 JSON 备份也能导入）。Markdown 导出只保留正文。": {
